OL,3,GNEWSABusy Inverclyde road closed due to
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA busy Inverclyde road has been closed
OL,7,Fin both directions due to a crash.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,10,FA8 Greenock Road between the Woodhall
OL,11,Froundabout in Port Glasgow and the B789
OL,12,FMain Road in Langbank at around 19:05.
OL,14,FReports on social media suggest the
OL,15,Fincident involved cars and a number of
OL,16,Fcyclists.
OL,18,FEmergency services are in attendance.
OL,19,FDrivers have been asked to avoid the
OL,20,Farea.
